@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
alt Take Photo via Camera
    User -> System : triggerCameraPhoto()
else Choose from Gallery
    User -> System : pickGalleryPhoto()
end
activate System

System --> User : displays photo preview and prompts for metrics (weight, height)
deactivate System

User -> System : submitsMetrics(weight, height)
activate System
note right of System: The system persists the photo and metrics\nlocally, recording timestamp and details.

System --> User : confirms entry saved and displays updated evolution journal
deactivate System

opt Delete Entry
    User -> System : deleteJournalEntry(selectedEntry)
    activate System
    System --> User : requests confirmation ("Are you sure?")
    deactivate System
    User -> System : confirmsDeletion()
    activate System
    System --> User : removes entry and photo from storage and refreshes gallery
    deactivate System
end

deactivate User
@enduml
